# GitHub Actions workflow YAML files often embed multi-line scripts
# (Python, shell) inside YAML string literals - these are automation
# definitions, not application source code, and prettier's YAML parser
# is not designed to handle arbitrary embedded script syntax inside
# them. Excluding the whole directory rather than picking specific
# files, since any future workflow could hit the same real issue.
.github/workflows/
node_modules/
.next/
